  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Food Security through Irrigation Farming in Malawi</narrative>
  </title>
  <description>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">The project aims to improve food security and income of rural farmers who are struggling with food insecurity and poverty. These farmers are dependent on rain-fed subsistence farming which is negatively affected by natural disasters, and a lack of resources and knowledge. The project will provide solar-powered irrigation systems, farm inputs and training to improve harvests. Improved harvests will lead to food security and income for the farmers and their families.</narrative>
  </description>
